    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 92,
        "text": "Hi everyone, thanks for coming to our first waste reduction meeting. Let's share ideas.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "4730103ca0baa96f425f7b3828d019fef1b48eee5b931a1388cfdb20a49734b0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 98,
        "sourceEnd": 193,
        "text": "I think we should start with plastic bags. If we use cloth bags, we will reduce a lot of waste.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "e35db1f511960d881beed11409fc3865110bd58576f47e344fd86ab6175521ab",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 199,
        "sourceEnd": 283,
        "text": "Good point. But some people forget their bags. Therefore, we need a reminder system.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "c4bf4ccbe40862de94ab02965b9713cc6c352de270b8a9146c295864822436d8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "cara",
        "speaker": "Cara",
        "sourceStart": 290,
        "sourceEnd": 420,
        "text": "I agree. If the supermarket puts a sign near the door, people will remember. Also, we could sell cheap cloth bags at the entrance.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "ceb1989dba8cdd567d96e6c00dc04aaacdbfb75fea78370d0fb351e73eac80df",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 426,
        "sourceEnd": 513,
        "text": "That's a good idea. But what about food waste? I read that we throw away too much food.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "8133bd7698a4831408a971821192015212e0d213f5d96ecdd2399652062e69fa",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 519,
        "sourceEnd": 663,
        "text": "Yes. If we plan our meals, we will buy only what we need. Because food waste is a big problem, we should also start a community compost project.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "3945b0bbaa030c4869fe89dd2d7405c6ae3105d76c9af6ebb1d10efa00f5359c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "cara",
        "speaker": "Cara",
        "sourceStart": 670,
        "sourceEnd": 800,
        "text": "I like the compost idea. But we need a place for it. If the council gives us a small area in the park, we can build a compost bin.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a41ce7445188c1b70cb782f85ed50fc543ba66b55ddb33109762e78036b9d4b7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 806,
        "sourceEnd": 901,
        "text": "And we could ask volunteers to manage it. Therefore, we need to find people who are interested.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "0f5e443ffe3b0bfb43327d6a8e704ab076472c691d655ca74cccb1d19c921844",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 907,
        "sourceEnd": 994,
        "text": "Right. Let's also think about paper. If we use both sides of paper, we will save trees.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "2c0e343e87ae5fc3d8bb4f1c6a58f01d6334f5297c1fe92334910726065ba158",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "cara",
        "speaker": "Cara",
        "sourceStart": 1001,
        "sourceEnd": 1089,
        "text": "True. But many offices already do that. Maybe we should focus on plastic and food first.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "a5f2ea33a495e3610d8dafcd7252ae87dbc009ad042b0cd1f6f167ac8e65546c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1095,
        "sourceEnd": 1195,
        "text": "Okay. So, if we start with these two, we will see results quickly. Then we can move to other things.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-EricNeural",
        "textHash": "7c0725e51e1d5466720255f81be350ec4bfee656ae032445b0ecfd7fbf9eb8c5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1201,
        "sourceEnd": 1274,
        "text": "Agreed. Let's write a short plan and present it to the council next week.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-JennyNeural",
        "textHash": "d41918479dd8f5778ffa56e4329ea161821cedbe4d90c26b62fabe1cca5b4156",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.45
      }
    ]
  },
